# Worktrees created in-tree. The rest of .claude/ is committed (CLAUDE.md,
# commands/, settings.json), so this needs an explicit rule: without it a
# worktree here is a second, untracked copy of the whole repo inside the repo,
# one `git add -A` away from being committed into itself.
/.claude/worktrees/
